The Lone Oak Ranch is a former horse ranch some 30 miles south of [[Geography/Althane/Salores/Toleros/index|Toleros]]. It used to be a supplier of horses for those traveling further south into the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/index|Lunae Badlands]], but lack of interest and competition from [[Bestiary/Beasts#Karpie|karpie]] ranchers drove the place out of business.

The ranch is currently occupied by [[People/Althane/Jake Halloway|Jake "Sureshot" Halloway]] and his posse.
